--Description:  
--Step-by-step in one query to answer: “Which five months (Aug-2022 → Nov-2023) had the largest month-over-month profit increase for Facebook-sourced completed orders?”  
--1) Filter ORDER_ITEMS to status='Complete'.  
--2) Join USERS to keep only traffic_source ILIKE '%facebook%'.  
--3) Restrict to orders created between 2022-08-01 and 2023-11-30 (micro-seconds).  
--4) Join PRODUCTS to obtain the unit cost.  
--5) Aggregate profit (sale_price − cost) by delivery_month.  
--6) Use LAG to compute month-over-month (MoM) change.  
--7) Pick the top 5 positive MoM jumps.  
WITH monthly_profit AS (   -- calc profit each delivery month
    SELECT
        TO_CHAR(TO_TIMESTAMP_NTZ(oi."delivered_at" / 1000000), 'YYYY-MM') AS "delivery_month",
        SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost") AS "monthly_profit"
    FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
    JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."USERS"        u
